# Identity plan adoption evidence

This packet records the source and data required for the identity integration partition in contract 1.0.12.
The actual generator must produce the plan; expected-plan data serves only as an independent comparison.

Normative and snapshot constructors retain their fixed inputs, bounds, private emission and source checks.
Original contract 1.0.11 bodies and failed attempts remain historical data; archived programs are never executed.

Source, execution, publication and main qualification have separate records and decision gates.
Native, UI, database, backend restart, capacity, parent acceptance and full SysON parity remain open.
